1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,060
Narrator: Listen to a school principal talking to a group of students.

2
00:00:04,060 --> 00:00:06,270
Principal: May I have your attention, please?

3
00:00:06,270 --> 00:00:12,222
We want to inform you that we will be hosting our second college visit trip

4
00:00:12,222 --> 00:00:16,190
with the students leaving next Friday and returning next Sunday.

5
00:00:16,190 --> 00:00:22,220
This trip will be limited to 35 students on a first come first serve basis.

6
00:00:22,220 --> 00:00:25,440
We will be traveling to San Diego

7
00:00:25,440 --> 00:00:31,120
and will make our way back up to Oxnard visiting colleges in-between.

8
00:00:31,120 --> 00:00:34,080
Come to the office to make the reservation

9
00:00:34,080 --> 00:00:39,050
and payment is due immediately to reserve your student's place.
